desmarcar todo las categorias que sale en registro del sistema
adb: ADB
aidi: AIDL calls
am: Activity Manager
audio: audio
binder_driver: Binder kernel driver
binder_lock: Binder global lock trace
bionic: bionic C library
camera: camera
cpu: callstack samples
dalvik: Dalvik VM
database: database
disk: Disk i/o
freq: CPU Frequency
gfx: Graphics
hal: hardware modules
idle: CPU idle
input: input
irq: IRQ events
logs: Android Logcat
memory: memory
memreclaim: kernel memory reclaim
network: network
nnapi: NNAPI
pdx: PDX services
pm: package manager
power: power management
res: Resource loading
rro: Runtime Resourse overlay
rs: RenderScript
sched: CPU Scheduling
sm: Sync Manager
ss: System Server
sync: synchronization
sys_stats: meminfo and vmstats
thermal: Thermal event
vibrator: Vibrator
video: video
view: View System
webview: webview
vm: windows manager


